- title: Implement serial V-sliced recurrent baseline
- difficulty_1_to_5: 3
- description: Implement a correctness-first Triton kernel in which each program owns one sequence, one value head, and a contiguous tile of V rows, retaining the corresponding FP32 [V_tile,128] state through the serial token loop.
